* Charrette
** Design premises
*** Settle before building
*** Diagrams as shared context
*** Documents outside the repository
*** Small increments
** Skills
*** One folder, SKILL.md + references/
*** Description = trigger only
*** One owner per protocol
*** Groups: project, architecture, ui,\nplan, execute, verify, workbench, review
** The loop
*** Entry: idea, board, module, roadmap slot
*** write-plan -> write-slice
*** execute-plan -> pr-review -> merge
*** roadmap above: iterations and slots
** Plan document
*** Design: why, before/after, modules, flows
*** Decisions table (D1...)
*** Slices, mandate, interview log
** Tracker
*** Glyphs: todo, running, done, paused, dropped
*** State node: branch, next, blocked
*** Mandate line
*** mermaid-check, tracker check
** Execution
*** execute-plan keeps the plan
*** orchestrate-plan dispatches
*** execute-slice does one slice
*** Mandate: mode, pace, PRs, tests, verify
*** swarm board for parallel slices
** Verification
*** verify-<app> skill (agent)
*** validate-delivery (person)
** aiview
*** CLI, Node server, React UI
*** SQLite index in the data home
*** Markdown, Mermaid, mockups, PDF
** Releases
*** Version bump in both manifests
*** Committed dist/ and dist-cli/
@endmindmap
